Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.71,0:00:02.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.33,0:00:03.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.03,0:00:04.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（警车警笛声）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.41,0:00:05.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发生什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.61,0:00:11.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打扫～。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.98,0:00:14.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吵死了 你这垃圾机器人。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.01,0:00:17.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打扫～。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.03,0:00:21.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）怎么了？到底。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.07,0:00:22.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的要求怎么样了？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.51,0:00:24.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这些人变成什么样都无所谓吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.78,0:00:26.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呀～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.47,0:00:28.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}钱。给我准备好钱。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.84,0:00:30.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有直升机。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.34,0:00:35.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}目前 在购物中心挟持人质的犯人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.05,0:00:37.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要求提供现金和逃跑用的直升机。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.75,0:00:42.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了 这是大事件啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.96,0:00:43.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.59,0:00:45.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（明里）游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.36,0:00:45.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.99,0:00:46.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（明里）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.35,0:00:47.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你现在在购物中心吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.68,0:00:49.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊？你在说什么啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.80,0:00:52.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我那个，学校……我还在学校。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.73,0:00:54.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.36,0:00:55.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没关系啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.76,0:00:56.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.77,0:00:57.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.61,0:00:59.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是。你在那里我可是知道的。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.80,0:01:03.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}电视上都好好拍到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.27,0:01:06.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？啊！真的上电视了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.87,0:01:09.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}听好了？去拍点什么独家画面回来。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.40,0:01:13.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算你这么说。真是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.78,0:01:16.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}除了逃跑用的直升机……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.45,0:01:18.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快点拿来，混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.99,0:01:22.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好可怕的脸。哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.36,0:01:24.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）看啊，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.67,0:01:25.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.05,0:01:27.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.24,0:01:29.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}犯人是 No.卡？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.43,0:01:31.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有点不妙。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.43,0:01:32.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.19,0:01:41.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）确认 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.22,0:01:43.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，开始狩猎吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.07,0:01:45.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（轨道7）遵命。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.36,0:01:59.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有点、有点不妙。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.05,0:02:03.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.45,0:02:08.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶，我的钱到底怎么了……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.87,0:02:17.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.58,0:02:22.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊哒～。哎？怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.29,0:02:24.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.26,0:02:25.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}时间停止了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.66,0:02:28.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么会这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.18,0:02:34.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（吹口哨）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.44,0:02:39.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.58,0:02:41.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.35,0:02:47.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.20,0:02:50.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}照亮人心深处淤积之暗的耀眼之光。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.40,0:02:54.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}人们称我为——No.猎人。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.62,0:02:56.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.猎人？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.73,0:03:00.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的 No.，就由我收下了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.68,0:03:08.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔。唔唔唔。竟敢动我的同伴。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.08,0:03:11.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种家伙咱们直接干掉吧老大。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.63,0:03:14.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不对，是快斗大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.36,0:03:15.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，决斗吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.99,0:03:19.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要把你的黑暗暴露出来。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.19,0:03:20.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.32,0:03:21.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错，No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.91,0:03:24.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只会附在决斗者身上。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.75,0:03:25.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.79,0:03:29.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡，叫 No.啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.29,0:03:31.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来你也
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.47,0:03:34.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有这张卡啊。有意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.68,0:03:38.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那反倒你的 No.就由我来收下了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.72,0:03:39.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}愚蠢。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.65,0:03:43.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就让我立刻送你解脱吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.09,0:03:45.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遵命。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.45,0:03:48.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗模式 光子变换。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.82,0:03:51.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.29,0:04:04.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，让我来狩猎吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.99,0:04:06.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连同你的灵魂一起。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.85,0:04:10.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等……等一下，让开啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.71,0:04:13.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，上面好像开始决斗了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.09,0:04:13.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.31,0:04:04.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.56,0:04:06.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什……什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.79,0:05:52.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}搞什么啊，你这家伙到底是……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.67,0:05:55.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}搞什么啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.69,0:05:59.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你那 No.卡的力量，就到此为止了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.06,0:06:03.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上！银河眼光子龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.10,0:06:05.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破灭的光子流！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.03,0:06:15.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.48,0:06:26.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子手。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.00,0:06:30.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……咕啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.34,0:06:45.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.者 捕获完毕。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.71,0:06:47.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遵命！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.22,0:06:53.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈 哈 哈 哈……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.61,0:06:57.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这 这是！？为什么犯人会……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.32,0:07:02.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}编……编……No.者·猎手。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.03,0:07:04.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 你在说什么啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.57,0:07:06.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.者·猎手？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.74,0:07:08.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《难道说！》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.78,0:07:12.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这是……》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.49,0:07:17.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.者被夺走了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.40,0:07:25.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是 刚才的……。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.93,0:07:27.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.95,0:07:30.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！ 什么啊 那个少年是。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.48,0:07:31.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抓住他！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.64,0:07:34.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个少年到底是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.35,0:07:36.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 从哪里进来的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.23,0:07:37.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老实点！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.21,0:07:40.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等…… 等一下～！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.85,0:07:58.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（奥博特们）垃圾 垃圾 垃圾 垃圾 垃圾……。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.59,0:08:02.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}垃圾 垃圾 垃圾 垃圾……。

Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.66,0:08:27.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（哈鲁特）让我听听……更多的惨叫吧！

Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.06,0:09:04.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}更多……更多……。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.92,0:09:08.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}库库库库……哈哈哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.63,0:09:11.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（心园）进来吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.36,0:09:16.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（心园）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.20,0:09:18.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡片的回收，进展顺利吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.23,0:09:19.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.63,0:09:23.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那真是太好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.61,0:09:26.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你热烈的决斗，将会为这座城市
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.83,0:09:30.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心园市带来和平。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.17,0:09:33.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 No.卡片收集到几张了？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.87,0:09:34.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奥比塔尔。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.62,0:09:35.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遵命！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.23,0:09:41.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}至今为止收集到的 No.卡片是11张。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.62,0:09:44.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.32,0:09:47.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这么短的时间内就能收集到这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.67,0:09:49.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的眼光果然没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.87,0:09:53.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.74,0:09:57.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是吗，看来你对于夺来的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.09,0:09:59.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是在担心被夺走的灵魂吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.97,0:10:02.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这也是没办法的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.15,0:10:04.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以我们现在的科学力量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.68,0:10:09.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}持有 No.卡的那些人的只能连同灵魂一起夺走。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.24,0:10:12.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 你不必在意。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.26,0:10:15.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}操纵 No.卡的那些家伙被邪气缠身{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.96,0:10:19.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}欲望被增幅的恶党罢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.51,0:10:24.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的 只要集齐100张 No.卡哈鲁特{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.89,0:10:27.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}弟弟就会变回原样对吧！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.58,0:10:28.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当然。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.78,0:10:31.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只有集齐 No.卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.29,0:10:33.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才能得到哈鲁特的治疗方法。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.56,0:10:35.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在 你就相信这一点吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.50,0:10:38.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}放心吧。 你那炽热的心意
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.72,0:10:42.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我会好好传达给菲卡博士的。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.40,0:10:44.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好的。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.92,0:10:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}继续去寻找 No.卡吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.80,0:10:53.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来　哈鲁特的治疗也能更快进行啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.32,0:11:09.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（Dr.费卡）怎么样了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.68,0:11:11.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡回收的成果……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.69,0:11:16.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Dr.费卡大人一切都在顺利推进。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.07,0:11:17.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（Dr.费卡）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.23,0:11:18.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵　是吗　那很好。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.93,0:11:25.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}人为了守护重要的东西总是会舍弃些什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.82,0:11:30.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就像我　为了守护这个世界舍弃了人类一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.04,0:11:36.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗也是为了守护哈鲁特才舍弃了人类。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.09,0:11:38.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是的　Dr.费卡大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.12,0:11:40.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我早就知道　总有一天
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.60,0:11:43.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会有来自星光体世界的使者到来。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.84,0:11:47.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那一天……　那一刻　毫无疑问
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.08,0:11:49.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那位使者　来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.40,0:11:51.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把那些家伙打个落花流水！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.84,0:11:53.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打得他们体无完肤！！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.94,0:11:57.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把那些残骸　送回那些家伙的世界去给我送回去！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.64,0:12:00.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}除此之外我们的世界没有别的活路！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.35,0:12:03.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遵命！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.20,0:12:05.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}购物中心挟持人质事件的新闻。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.56,0:12:08.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和挟持犯一起被制服的这名少年{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.60,0:12:12.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然在警队和犯人之间突然……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.13,0:12:14.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以　你就这么成了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.12,0:12:17.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}独家新闻的主角？　哈——。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.17,0:12:19.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马这家伙不知不觉间
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.11,0:12:21.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就混进现场了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.04,0:12:23.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过　是怎么做到的？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.10,0:12:25.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘛　细节就别在意了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.92,0:12:26.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的～。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.84,0:12:27.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.45,0:12:30.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.的事不打算说吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.31,0:12:31.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}笨蛋！姐姐她
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.91,0:12:34.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是禁止我决斗的啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.69,0:12:36.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能说得出口……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.81,0:12:37.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯～？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.55,0:12:39.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，不是，没什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.25,0:12:40.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙，难道说！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.56,0:12:41.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.26,0:12:43.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我才没搞什么决斗呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.72,0:12:45.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.猎人。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.29,0:12:48.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（喧闹声）

Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.33,0:13:10.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢谢。啊，啊～。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.51,0:13:24.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.49,0:13:28.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特，怎么样了？身体还好吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.39,0:13:29.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.64,0:13:31.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.25,0:13:34.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么大家都在笑呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.62,0:13:39.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我需要的明明不是笑声啊{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.50,0:13:41.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我需要的，是惨叫声。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.79,0:13:43.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能让我平静下来的……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.88,0:13:47.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对我来说需要更多更多　惨叫声。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.75,0:13:52.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.30,0:13:55.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥　我是不是很奇怪……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.83,0:13:59.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不你只是做了个噩梦而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.37,0:14:00.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}梦？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.51,0:14:05.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊　是个噩梦。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.08,0:14:08.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但放心吧。　我一定会把你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.53,0:14:11.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从那个梦中唤醒。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.87,0:14:17.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.81,0:14:19.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干嘛啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.23,0:14:21.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果　除我之外的某个人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.00,0:14:23.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在收集 No.卡的话……。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.27,0:14:26.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是说 No.猎人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.63,0:14:29.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说　那个猎人总有一天
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.34,0:14:31.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可能会找到我这里来。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.85,0:14:33.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}猎人要　查明你的所在
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.91,0:14:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}应该不会太远了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.39,0:14:38.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 说不定已经被知道了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.59,0:14:41.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么 你这家伙 在害怕吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.11,0:14:43.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要不 我就用决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.21,0:14:45.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来帮你做个了断吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.83,0:14:47.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《有种不好的预感…》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.41,0:14:55.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）然后 隔壁镇上
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.00,0:14:57.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}建了个超大的决斗广场哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.28,0:14:58.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超厉害的啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.75,0:15:01.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这周日 大家一起去吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.49,0:15:02.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 小鸟。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.41,0:15:05.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你见识见识我的 一飞冲天！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.02,0:15:07.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）哎～！？ 你要是能赢的话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.53,0:15:09.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我倒是可以看看哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.93,0:15:15.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～ 好可惜啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.29,0:15:18.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是刚才那下攻击打中了的话…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.67,0:15:20.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 小鸟。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.00,0:15:23.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的… 结果还不是全败嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.66,0:15:24.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说你啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.88,0:15:27.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天就是要去挑战
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.41,0:15:29.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不放弃才是最重要的。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.76,0:15:31.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么时候才能赢啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.20,0:15:32.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下次一定能赢，下次。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.79,0:15:33.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.63,0:15:34.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.19,0:15:37.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然，还是该警惕。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.00,0:15:38.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我有种不好的预感。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.78,0:15:40.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说，又是那事啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.88,0:15:42.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.06,0:15:45.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，没什么，没什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.25,0:15:45.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下雨？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.77,0:15:47.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了，下起来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.62,0:15:49.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}走了，小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.25,0:15:50.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.16,0:15:54.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.68,0:15:56.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太慢了，小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.54,0:15:58.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的，等等我……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.73,0:16:00.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（喇叭声）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.41,0:16:05.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.45,0:16:07.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.33,0:16:12.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.70,0:16:17.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？这是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.10,0:16:22.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.97,0:16:26.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这到底是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.50,0:16:30.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！和那时候一样！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.54,0:16:31.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个口哨声！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.97,0:16:32.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.87,0:16:33.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（口哨）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.91,0:16:42.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（口哨）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.50,0:16:44.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.52,0:16:49.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哦！你…你是谁？你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.56,0:16:52.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是你干的好事吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.76,0:16:56.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在 这个艾莉娅正在展开特殊场地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.13,0:16:58.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}时间的流逝被调成了万分之一。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.32,0:17:02.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（轨道7）是我 轨道7的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.53,0:17:05.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）在这个空间里能行动的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.51,0:17:07.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只有拥有 No.卡的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.91,0:17:10.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然你这家伙，持有 No.卡啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.78,0:17:12.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡！？不会吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.86,0:17:14.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.猎人！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.65,0:17:17.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，这家伙很危险！快逃！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.02,0:17:18.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快、快逃什么的……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.05,0:17:24.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊！这、这是什么鬼东西！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.75,0:17:27.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凭借这个决斗锚，从现在开始
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.10,0:17:28.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到决斗分出胜负为止。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.80,0:17:29.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.30,0:17:32.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和你是无法分开的。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.00,0:17:32.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.83,0:17:37.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说，你这家伙是不可能从决斗中逃走的。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.71,0:17:40.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让我来猎取吧，你的 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.57,0:17:44.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然不知道你是谁但送上门的架我可不会不接！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.44,0:17:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，这场决斗，我也来助你一臂之力。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.15,0:17:49.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在说什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.40,0:17:51.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明刚才还怕得要死！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.35,0:17:53.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不相信什么直觉。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.93,0:17:56.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，这个对手不一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.40,0:17:58.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凭你一个人是赢不了的对手。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.92,0:18:01.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎，那家伙有那么强吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.62,0:18:04.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恐怕，比你至今为止战斗过的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.65,0:18:09.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，比我战斗过的任何人都要强。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.53,0:18:15.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然你都这么说了那我就更加来劲了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.43,0:18:19.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也是以决斗冠军为目标的！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.65,0:18:24.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天！我！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.52,0:18:27.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗模式 光子转换！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.91,0:18:32.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什、什么！？

Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.74,0:18:50.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}AR视界 连接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.44,0:18:54.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，让我来猎杀吧{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.31,0:18:56.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连同你的灵魂一起！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.95,0:19:01.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.48,0:19:05.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻是我！我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.86,0:19:08.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动 魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.20,0:19:09.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子帷幕。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.26,0:19:15.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是将手牌中的光属性怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.44,0:19:17.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}3只返回卡组{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.13,0:19:19.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再从卡组中将光属性怪兽3只
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.70,0:19:20.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加入手牌。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.67,0:19:23.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}3只都换掉了……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.37,0:19:26.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着发动速攻魔法 光子引导。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.57,0:19:29.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是将从卡组加入手牌的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.67,0:19:32.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级4以下的光属性怪兽1只{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.96,0:19:35.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以攻击表示特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.49,0:19:38.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我特殊召唤 破晓者！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.25,0:19:48.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡特殊召唤成功时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.11,0:19:52.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌中将同名卡1只特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.00,0:19:54.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.77,0:19:56.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}另一只破晓者！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.70,0:19:59.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新出现的破晓者效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.92,0:20:04.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再特殊召唤一只破晓者！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.62,0:20:08.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一口气召唤了3只怪兽！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.15,0:20:10.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不妙！那家伙场上出现的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.17,0:20:12.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽全都是等级4！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.19,0:20:14.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.87,0:20:17.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把等级4的3只破晓者
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.12,0:20:17.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.12,0:20:23.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用3只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.14,0:20:24.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.82,0:20:27.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.03,0:20:31.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.03,0:20:35.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.10 白辉士 启明者！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.32,0:20:43.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.17,0:20:46.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}第1回合就召唤出了 No.怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.70,0:20:49.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完。我发动 No.10
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.64,0:20:51.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}启明者的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.91,0:20:53.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}启明者1回合1次
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.53,0:20:55.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过使用叠放单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.29,0:20:57.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将1张手牌送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.81,0:21:01.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从卡组抽1张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.52,0:21:04.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，现在发动送去墓地的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.24,0:21:06.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光蛇的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.73,0:21:08.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光蛇从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.55,0:21:10.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被送去墓地时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.09,0:21:13.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤到场上！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.82,0:21:18.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且我还要通常召唤等离子球！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.73,0:21:23.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又、又来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.66,0:21:25.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来就有3只怪兽了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.76,0:21:29.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙到底打算召唤多少只怪兽啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.30,0:21:31.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不…这是。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.82,0:21:34.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将等级3的光蛇和
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.86,0:21:38.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等离子球进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.04,0:21:39.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.06,0:21:40.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.74,0:21:42.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.46,0:21:48.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，No.20！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.74,0:21:59.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蚁岩土 亮辉！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.62,0:22:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骗人的吧！？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.82,0:22:06.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1个回合就召唤了2只 No.怪兽…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.33,0:22:08.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，狩猎开始了。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.05,0:22:15.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗，开始吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.93,0:22:17.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）本周的问题。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.93,0:22:19.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}基本 场地上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.63,0:22:22.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽 最多 能召唤几只？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.32,0:22:24.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}5只？ 还是6只？

Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.60,0:23:44.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙，强得离谱啊啊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.73,0:23:48.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个男人的决斗，难道在我之上吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.37,0:23:51.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骗人的吧 我在害怕决斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.98,0:23:53.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！克服恐惧！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.01,0:23:57.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗！我和你合力上！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.91,0:23:59.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结束了…这样下去……
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.41,0:24:01.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.06,0:24:06.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下集 游戏王ZEXAL 『银河眼光子龙』降临！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.50,0:24:09.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天啊啊啊！我！！

Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.51,0:24:14.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}答案是 5只。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.87,0:24:17.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽要是排了5只
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.14,0:24:19.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那得有多震撼啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.42,0:24:22.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔～！ 我也想召唤好多
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.25,0:24:24.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽来打一场啊！

